  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_anise_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>anise, an umbelliferous plant (Pimpinella Anisum) native to the Levant and cultivated for its aromatic and carminative seeds, used medically (OED s.v. anise)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
